Package: fcitx5-pingzhu
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, fcitx5
Description: PingZhu (平注) Bopomofo input method engine for fcitx5
 PingZhu is an open-source cross-platform Bopomofo (Zhuyin) IME engine.
 This package provides the fcitx5 addon, its input method definition and
 the engine data, so the input method can be used on fcitx5-based
 distributions (openEuler, UOS, Kylin, deepin, ...).
